class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"40.1\" width=\"320\" height=\"4.399999999999999\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,94.9 14.2,89.6 19.3,93.1 24.5,96.5 29.6,93.1 34.7,95.8 39.8,91.6 44.9,88.8 50.0,92.1 55.1,85.9 60.3,84.4 65.4,79.7 70.5,77.8 75.6,71.1 80.7,65.9 85.8,64.2 91.0,62.4 96.1,59.8 101.2,53.6 106.3,38.3 111.4,38.8 116.5,39.4 121.6,42.6 126.8,73.2 131.9,77.9 137.0,81.2 142.1,76.4 147.2,73.8 152.3,78.7 157.4,68.0 162.6,65.7 167.7,79.4 172.8,80.3 177.9,77.4 183.0,60.4 188.1,62.9 193.2,41.6 198.4,47.6 203.5,57.2 208.6,48.3 213.7,40.3 218.8,47.2 223.9,39.2 229.0,24.2 234.2,32.9 239.3,25.1 244.4,22.5 249.5,34.0 254.6,41.2 259.7,19.4 264.9,26.7 270.0,35.5 275.1,31.1 280.2,12.8 285.3,32.9 290.4,35.6 295.5,27.7 300.7,38.2 305.8,30.6 310.9,36.4 316.0,32.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 254.6 53.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 275.1 43.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 300.7 50.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"32.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%